# Optional static torchtitan overrides applied on top of the registered `qwen3_14b`
# config, appended by scripts/run_torchtitan.sh. The launcher already sets the
# per-cell knobs (--training.steps/seq_len/local_batch_size/global_batch_size,
# --parallelism.data_parallel_shard_degree, activation checkpointing), so this file
# is normally empty. Add one flag per line to customize (e.g. enable compile).
# Confirm names for the pinned commit with:
#   python -m torchtitan.train --module qwen3 --config qwen3_14b --help
